        "options": {
            "A": "dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1] + 1",
            "B": "dp[i][j] = max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1])",
            "C": "dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j] + 1",
            "D": "dp[i][j] = dp[i][j - 1]"
        },
        "answer": "A",
        "explanation": "末尾字符相等时，LCS 在去掉两末尾字符的基础上加 1。"
